{"sha": "f938a0f0d415b8ba280865f6e8fb0a77b7ab66d8a43f933d701c2619ecfe6bc9", "body": ["\\begin{example}[线性斯塔克效应]\\label{ex:b3:perturbation-theory:stark}", "\\index{斯塔克效应}", "氢原子的 $n = 2$ 能级包含简并的 $2s$ 态与 $2p$ 态。", "在电场 $\\mathcal E\\vect e_z$ 中，$\\hat V = e\\mathcal E\\hat z$", "使 $2s$ 与 $2p_0$ 耦合，矩阵元为 $\\bra{2s}\\hat z\\ket{2p_0} = -3a_0$：", "对该 $2\\times2$ 块作对角化，得能量移动：", "\\[", "\\Delta E = \\pm\\,3e a_0\\mathcal E ,", "\\]", "\\emph{线性地}依赖于场 --- 而非简并的基态", "仅按场强的二次方移动。当 $\\mathcal E = \\qty{e7}{V/m}$ 时，移动为 $\\pm", "\\qty{1.6}{meV}$，是一个易于分辨的分裂。", "产生分裂的态为 $(\\ket{2s} \\mp \\ket{2p_0})/\\sqrt2$ --- 具有永久电偶极子的杂化态，", "只因简并使原子能在零级近似下自由极化，这才成为可能。", "（同样的 $s$--$p$", "杂化，只是由邻近原子而非外场驱动，", "正是每种有机分子中碳的化学成键。）", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,1.5) -- (2.1,1.5);", "  \\node[anchor=east, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.1,1.5)", "    {$n = 2$：$2s, 2p$（简并）};", "  \\draw[gray, dashed] (2.1,1.5) -- (3.4,2.4);", "  \\draw[gray, dashed] (2.1,1.5) -- (3.4,1.5);", "  \\draw[gray, dashed] (2.1,1.5) -- (3.4,0.6);", "  \\draw[very thick, omThm] (3.4,2.4) -- (5.6,2.4);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.7,2.4)", "    {$(\\ket{2s} - \\ket{2p_0})/\\sqrt2$：$+3ea_0\\mathcal E$};", "  \\draw[very thick, omExo] (3.4,1.5) -- (5.6,1.5);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.7,1.5)", "    {$2p_{\\pm1}$：未移动};", "  \\draw[very thick, omThm] (3.4,0.6) -- (5.6,0.6);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.7,0.6)", "    {$(\\ket{2s} + \\ket{2p_0})/\\sqrt2$：$-3ea_0\\mathcal E$};", "  \\draw[->, thick] (1.05,0.15) -- (1.05,-0.55);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.15,-0.2)", "    {接入电场 $\\mathcal E$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 氢原子 $n = 2$ 壳层中的线性斯塔克效应：电场使简并的", "$2s$ 与 $2p_0$ 杂化为", "具有永久电偶极子的态，能量移动 $\\pm3ea_0\\mathcal E$，", "而 $2p_{\\pm1}$ 在一阶近似下保持不变。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{跃迁：黄金规则}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[含时微扰]\\label{thm:b3:perturbation-theory:golden}", "\\index{费米黄金规则}", "接通 $\\hat V(t) = \\hat V\\cos\\omega t$，起始时刻 $t = 0$。一阶近似下，", "系统处于 $\\ket f$ 态、时刻为 $t$ 的概率，", "初始态为 $\\ket i$，则为", "\\[", "\\mathcal P_{i\\to f}(t) = \\frac{|\\bra f\\hat V\\ket i|^2}{4\\hbar^2}\\;", "\\frac{\\sin^2\\!\\big[(\\omega_{fi} - \\omega)\\,t/2\\big]}", "{\\big[(\\omega_{fi} - \\omega)/2\\big]^2} ,", "\\qquad \\omega_{fi} = \\frac{E_f - E_i}{\\hbar} :", "\\]", "在 $\\hbar\\omega = E_f - E_i$ 处出现尖锐的共振峰 ---", "当 $E_f > E_i$ 时为吸收，", "对于 $E_f < E_i$ 的伴随项则为\\emph{受激辐射}。若终态构成密度为 $\\rho(E)$ 的连续谱，", "其峰值的增长变为恒定的", "\\emph{速率}：", "\\[", "\\Gamma_{i\\to f} = \\frac{2\\pi}{\\hbar}\\,", "|\\bra f\\hat V\\ket i|^2\\,\\rho(E_f)", "\\]", "--- \\emph{费米黄金规则}，是衰变速率、", "吸收系数与截面的基本公式。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "一阶振幅：$c_f(t) = -\\tfrac{\\iu}{\\hbar}\\int_0^t\\bra", "f\\hat V(t')\\ket i\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\omega_{fi}t'}\\dd t'$；保留近共振指数项，", "并积分，即得所给的", "$\\sin^2$ 形式。对于连续谱，作为失谐量", "$x$ 的函数，共振因子的高度为 $t^2$，宽度 $\\sim 2\\pi/t$", "--- 面积 $2\\pi t$ --- 故对光滑连续谱求和时，", "它被替换为 $2\\pi t\\,\\rho$：概率关于 $t$ 线性增长，即为速率。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=8.0cm, height=5.2cm, xmin=-14, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=1.18,", "    xlabel={失谐量 $(\\omega_{fi} - \\omega)\\,t$}, ylabel={$\\mathcal P_{i\\to f}$（归一化）},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={-6.28,6.28}, xticklabels={$-2\\pi$,$+2\\pi$}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=-14:14, samples=300]", "      {(abs(x)<0.01) ? 1 : sin(deg(x/2))^2/(x/2)^2};", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.3,0.97)", "      {高度 $\\propto t^2$，宽度 $\\propto 1/t$};", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.6cm, yshift=0.6cm, >=Stealth, font=\\small]", "    \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- (1.4,0);", "    \\node[anchor=east, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.08,0) {$\\ket i$};", "    \\fill[omExo!22] (0,2.0) rectangle (1.4,3.2);", "    \\foreach \\y in {2.1,2.3,2.5,2.7,2.9,3.1} \\draw[omExo!70] (0,\\y) -- (1.4,\\y);", "    \\node[anchor=east, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.08,2.6) {连续谱 $\\rho(E)$};", "    \\draw[->, omThm, very thick] (0.7,0.08) -- (0.7,2.45);", "    \\node[omThm, anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (0.82,1.3) {$\\Gamma = \\frac{2\\pi}{\\hbar}|V_{fi}|^2\\rho$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：一阶跃迁概率关于失谐量", "的变化 --- 一个越来越窄、越来越高的共振峰，其面积", "随时间线性增长。右：跃迁到连续谱时，这种线性增长", "即为恒定的衰变速率，即黄金规则。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}